 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Lovely. What kind of kid is he, outdoorsy or more indoors? That's the human cannonball, or the high flyer. It hurts a bit, but it' great fun. Which would you rather avoid? Lots of family parks have free days, and you could add something small like an ice cream afterwards. Some parks have kiddie restaurants, you can see from the outside. Or you can pack a snack and go straight to the slide. Good plan. And maybe save the high flyer for a sunny day, it's best with lots of light.",
